Add the interior-entry dispatch targets to the engine entry_points. Each is an interior address of a
function reached only by a runtime-computed `jalr`/`jr` (packed sub-functions and shared return
epilogues), so the control-flow analyzer cannot discover them as switch-case labels. collectInternal
EntryTargetsImpl turns each into a `case 0x…u: goto label_…;` arm of its owner function.

--- a/w251-engine_authoritative.toml
